<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Aroma half yr shr slips, to change yr end.</title>
<headline>Aroma half yr shr slips, to change yr end.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     3.5	   vs 4.7</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   0.57	  vs 0.76</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.62	  vs 1.01</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.03	  vs 0.23</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.28	  vs 0.11 received</p>
<p>    Turnover		  87.85	 vs 88.82</p>
<p>Full name: Aroma Liquor Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said Aroma's year end will be changed to June 30 in order to conform with that of controlling shareholder DJI Clothing Ltd took a 50.3 percent stake in Aroma in November.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
